  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.149` to `4.1.156`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.149...application_builder_helpers/4.1.156)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump AbsolutePathHelpers from 0.3.149 to 0.3.151 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/700\n* Bump Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions from 10.0.12 to 10.0.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/702\n* Bump Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk from 18.10.1 to 18.11.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/701\n* Bump System.Security.Cryptography.Xml from 10.0.11 to 10.0.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/705\n* Bump System.Security.Cryptography.Xml from 10.0.12 to 10.0.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/707\n* Bump NukeBuildHelpers from 9.0.47 to 9.0.49 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/703\n* Bump Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly.Server from 10.0.12 to 10.0.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/708\n* Bump Microsoft.AspNetCore.SignalR.Common from 10.0.12 to 10.0.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/710\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20261013061220.fd6030d...build.20261014173323.a4e8110",
